@fredmtyro I tried your reproducer with #8012 and the test now passes if you use:

```
    @TestFactory
    fun `tests`() = mapOf(
            "condition" to "mock"
    ).map { (condition, argument) ->
        QuarkusDynamicTest.dynamicTest("'${condition}' '${argument}'") {
            println("testFactory")
            mockExternalService.service()
        }
    }
```
